WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.900
Data Minimisation means collecting only
what is necessary for the study aims.

2
00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.720
Anonymisation removes all identifiable
information entirely.

3
00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:12.660
Pseudonymisation replaces identifiable
information with a unique secure

4
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:17.500
identifier. Study participants must be
explicitly informed about how their

5
00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:22.200
information will be used and how long it
will be retained, who to contact,

6
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.680
and their right to request data deletion
at any time.

7
00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:30.500
Executed correctly, a formal data
management plan acts as a dual shield,

8
00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:34.820
protecting both the legal liability of the
institution and the ethical rights

9
00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.260
of the human subjects.
